    "updated_at": "2021-09-21T17:03:32Z",
    "body": "Hello! The documentation does not mention that but it is possible to configure `shell` module to set it's output color.\r\n\r\n```\r\n[shell]\r\ndisabled=false\r\nformat=\"[$indicator](bold yellow) \"\r\n\r\n```\r\n<img width=\"739\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2981598/134214854-cbdb2225-cdba-4f02-8821-bd1f80a04201.png\">\r\n\r\n\r\nor set color for particular shell\r\n\r\n```\r\n[shell]\r\ndisabled=false\r\nzsh_indicator=\"[zsh](red bold)\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n<img width=\"770\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2981598/134215270-fb130e12-aad3-443b-a33a-5011a0507f9d.png\">\r\n\r\n ",
