    "body": "Thanks ... that works! 🎉 \r\n\r\nBecause I was converting from a custom module. I had tried to follow the style convention\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n[shell]\r\nstyle = \"bold cyan\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n... but this was giving me `[WARN] - (starship::configs::shell): Unknown config key 'style'`\r\n\r\nIf I get a change, I'll look into a PR for documentation or adding the config. Unless someone else beats me too it.",
